<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#Sx7.SSx1" title="In Additional Experiments ‣ Knowledge Graph Tokenization for Behavior-Aware Generative Next POI Recommendation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Effect of Backbone Language Models</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#Sx7.SSx2" title="In Additional Experiments ‣ Knowledge Graph Tokenization for Behavior-Aware Generative Next POI Recommendation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Analysis of Auxiliary Behavior Learning</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#Sx7.SSx3" title="In Additional Experiments ‣ Knowledge Graph Tokenization for Behavior-Aware Generative Next POI Recommendation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Analysis of Sequential Pattern Modeling</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
</ol></nav>
